<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HANOVER GRAND PRIX WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in</p>
<p>the $450,000 Hanover Grand Prix women's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Monday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>6-Barbara Paulus (Austria) beat Anne Miller (U.S.) 6-0 6-0</p>
<p>Magdalena Maleeva (Bulgaria) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 3-6 6-1 6-4</p>
</text>
